SECTION 8: KNOWN ISSUES & TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

Possible Issues & Solutions:

1. Grafana pods pending (0/1 Pending)
   Issue: Waiting for persistent volume claim
   Action: Check storage: kubectl describe pvc -n platform-system
   Action: Check nodes: kubectl describe nodes

2. cert-manager startupapicheck incomplete
   Issue: CRDs still being registered
   Action: This is normal during startup; will complete automatically
   Wait: Usually completes within 1 minute

3. Prometheus server not starting (0/2 containers)
   Issue: Persistent volume not ready
   Action: Check PV status: kubectl get pv
   Action: Check PVC: kubectl describe pvc -n platform-system

4. Rancher pods pending after installation
   Issue: Waiting for TLS certificate from cert-manager
   Action: Check certificate status: kubectl get certificate -n platform-system
   Action: Check cert-manager logs: kubectl logs -n platform-system \
           pod/cert-manager-677fb4c6f6-6tkbh

5. High memory usage
   Issue: Multiple components uploading large configurations
   Action: Monitor with: docker stats
   Action: Give 2-3 minutes for stabilization
   Action: If system freezes, check: kubectl top nodes

